DOM: XML documents through the Document Object Model API, with libxml2
of the package az.

The module dom of PHP 8.1 for php81 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20210902/dom.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php81/conf.d, its headers in
include/php81/php/ext/dom.
